{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/compare/978cc5b445edb9943fd9953b0a9037d97a9f33a8...a0e80de64aa5394a42b1c9a237c15047ec766f73","html_url":"https://github.com/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/compare/978cc5b445edb9943fd9953b0a9037d97a9f33a8...a0e80de64aa5394a42b1c9a237c15047ec766f73","permalink_url":"https://github.com/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/compare/conjectures-io:978cc5b...conjectures-io:a0e80de","diff_url":"https://github.com/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/compare/978cc5b445edb9943fd9953b0a9037d97a9f33a8...a0e80de64aa5394a42b1c9a237c15047ec766f73.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/compare/978cc5b445edb9943fd9953b0a9037d97a9f33a8...a0e80de64aa5394a42b1c9a237c15047ec766f73.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"978cc5b445edb9943fd9953b0a9037d97a9f33a8","node_id":"C_kwDOU-E3Y9oAKDk3OGNjNWI0NDVlZGI5OTQzZmQ5OTUzYjBhOTAzN2Q5N2E5ZjMzYTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"dendrite-belps","email":"ac@dendrite.holdings","date":"2026-10-15T13:19:13Z"},"committer":{"name":"dendrite-belps","email":"ac@dendrite.holdings","date":"2026-10-15T13:19:13Z"},"message":"Revert \"Add the exact-runtime slot: thirteen proved neural-network kernels scored on a calibrated model suite, with fixtures, tests, a showcase benchmark and its guide.\"\n\nThis reverts commit 3e8015b3c904c2b3217e55b95f1aed59991148b6.","tree":{"sha":"d790bec3b28ddf83e341a1c4e427622985a045b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/git/trees/d790bec3b28ddf83e341a1c4e427622985a045b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/git/commits/978cc5b445edb9943fd9953b0a9037d97a9f33a8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/conjectures-io/conj